<section id="S4.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.5 </span>Statistical Validation</h3>

<div id="S4.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To validate these improvements, we calculated Cohen’s <math id="S4.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> effect size:</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="S4.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=\frac{\mu_{\text{CAT}}-\mu_{\text{baseline}}}{\sigma_{\text{pooled}}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>CAT</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>pooled</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=\frac{\mu_{\text{CAT}}-\mu_{\text{baseline}}}{\sigma_{\text{pooled}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Note that we specifically compare against the baseline Alexa+ system without CAT enhancements to isolate the framework’s impact. Table <a href="#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 4.5 Statistical Validation ‣ 4 Results and Analysis ‣ Creative Adversarial Testing (CAT): A Novel Framework for Evaluating Goal-Oriented Agentic AI Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> presents the statistical analysis across key metrics, with all improvements showing statistical significance (<math id="S4.SS5.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.001</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
